 "secondary_7", "content": "Understands simple information in slow conversations about the communicative topics and vocabulary related to this level.  "}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Understands key information in written texts about the communicative topics related to this level."}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " Responding to Good and Bad News"}, {"type": "describer", "content": " Here are the different ways to respond to good and bad news."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":3,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\"> Examples </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" To respond to good news\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Congratulations! <br />That's great/fantastic/wonderful! <br />What great/fantastic/wonderful news! <br />That's great/fantastic/wonderful news! <br />I'm glad to hear that!</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" To respond to bad news\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Oh no/dear! <br />That's too bad! <br />I can't believe it! <br />I'm sorry to hear that ... <br />That's unfortunate/awful! <br />I know how you must be feeling!</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " The Modal Can"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You use the modal can for 3 things:"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<li> to ask and talk about what is possible.  <li> to say you have an ability or know how to  do something.  <li>to ask for permission or give someone permission."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":4,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Use</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Examples</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Possibility\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> Can you please wait? </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Ability\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> I can write it down. </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Permission\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Can I speak to Mr. Jones, please?</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "in response to "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "something that you say or write as a reaction to something else "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I'm calling in response to your voicemail."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le08ob11aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " These are words to review!"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "voicemail "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a recorded message a person leaves on the phone "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I am listening to your voicemail."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le08ob11aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "news "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "new information "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I have some bad news!"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le08ob11aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to regret "}, {"type": "definition", "content": " to say that you are sorry for something"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I regret to inform you that you are not who we are looking for."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le08ob11aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to write down "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to write something on a piece of paper "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Let me write it down for you."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le08ob11aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to come up "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to appear "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: My e-mails aren't coming up."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le08ob11aud06"}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn2le08ob11re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Find a partner."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Share some good or bad news with them."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Your partner responds to the news."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Switch roles."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I find a partner to role play an activity."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I give good or bad news to a partner."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I respond to good or bad news."}]}], "type": "sena"}